abstract: >-
  R scripts, generated C++ simulator source, reference outputs, and the standalone
  LaTeX source of Figure 1 for the article "How Withheld Punishment Sustains
  Anti-Democratic Behavior in an Evolutionary Game". The scripts reproduce Figures
  2-4, the numerical checks of Propositions 1 and 2, and every number quoted in the
  article's Section 4.3 (finite-population simulations of the resurgence cycle).
